      "content": "i get that, but i've heard that if you just take a smaller dose of the st johns wort like maybe 200mg instead of the full dose it won't affect the warfarin as much. since it's just a supplement and not a prescription drug, do you think that would be a safe way to try it out without needing to call my doctor right away?",
